# The hub at www.bfloore.online is this repo root on Vercel.
# The resume deploys on its own from Cloudflare Pages (project bfloore-resume).
# The hub Resume / CV link points at https://resume.bfloore.online/ and does not
# need these files. Ignoring the directory is what keeps raw source such as
# resume/site.config.js and resume/README.md off the public hub.
resume/
resume/site.config.js
resume/README.md
